        <p class="text-base font-medium text-center leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
          Compassionate, trauma-informed emotional support available 24/7. Helps process triggers, recognize patterns, and understand trauma responses. Voice or text input—express yourself however feels comfortable.
        </p>
