              <strong class="text-base" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">NOT Therapy <span class="text-lg">💬</span></strong>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary)">
              This is a trauma recovery resource, not medical treatment. Designed to complement professional mental health care.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-lg bg-white border-l-4" style="border-color: #3a5a8c;">
            <div class="text-center mb-3">
              <strong class="text-base" style="color: var(--color-text-primary)">Trauma-Informed <span class="text-lg">🛡️</span></strong>
